Blue-green deployment is a deployment strategy used to release new versions of software with zero downtime and minimal risk.
🔵 Blue Environment (Current Live): This is the version of your application currently serving production traffic.
🟢 Green Environment (New Version): You deploy the new version of your application here - and do the testing.
Once you're confident it works, update the load balancer / router to send all production traffic to Green.
Blue Becomes Idle (Rollback Option)
If everything works: Blue is now idle and can be updated next time.
If something breaks: instantly switch back to Blue → fast rollback.

